OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped and sexually abused
OL,4,Ayoung girl jailed for eight years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped and sexually abused a
OL,7,Fgirl - beginning when she was 10 years
OL,8,Fold - has been jailed for eight years.
OL,10,FMichael Robb, 74, carried out the
OL,11,Fattacks at locations in the north of
OL,12,FScotland between 1982 and 1986,
OL,13,Ftargeting the child when she was
OL,14,Fsleeping.
OL,16,FThe victim told the High Court in
OL,17,FInverness how she protested during the
OL,18,Fabuse, while Robb denied the charges
OL,19,Fand accused the woman of "fabricating"
OL,20,Fher account.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
