OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped and sexually abused
OL,4,Ayoung girl jailed for eight years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was found guilty of lewd and
OL,7,Flibidinous behaviour and practices,
OL,8,Findecent assault, and rape. A judge
OL,9,Fsaid Robb had caused her "substantial"
OL,10,Fharm, and that she had since lived with
OL,11,Fpanic attacks, depression and suicidal
OL,12,Fthoughts.
